<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: left; height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="line-height: 15px; height: 15px; width: 680px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"></div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><a href="http://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2013300744/device-tp.jpg" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" style="width: 680px; height: 70px;"></font></a></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2022470185/180312_QBR+SME+Non+product.jpg" title="Qantas Business Rewards" alt="Qantas Business Rewards" width="680" height="453" style="width: 680px; height: 453px;"></font></td></tr></tbody></table><table id="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: left; height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; margin: 0px;"></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">An update from Qantas Business Rewards</font></h3></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thanks for taking time on the phone, {!Contact.FirstName}.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">As discussed, we don't like seeing members miss out on Qantas Points. So here are a few tips to make sure your business is getting all the rewards it's entitled to as part of your Qantas Business Rewards membership.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Add your ABN</b><br>The most important thing is that you and your employees travelling with Qantas for business add your company's ABN and their Qantas Frequent Flyer number when making an eligible booking, which in turn earns your business and employees Qantas Points for the very same flight<sup style="line-height: 11px; font-size: 11px;">1</sup>.<br><br></font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Using a travel agent?</b><br>No problem. Just make sure they know you're a Qantas Business Rewards member and remind them to add your company's ABN to your Qantas bookings. They'll also need to know which Qantas Business Rewards membership level your business is on.<br><br></font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Communicate your travel policy</b><br>Let employees know that when booking their own eligible Qantas flights for business to enter your company's ABN every time when making the booking. That way, your business earns Qantas Points as does the Frequent Flyer traveller<sup style="line-height: 11px; font-size: 11px;">2</sup>, for the same flight.<br><br></font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Managing your account</b><br>You can add travellers to your Qantas Business Rewards account, as well as payment details and other access permissions, like being able to book flights with the Qantas App.</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="left" class="w100perc" style="margin: 0px auto;"><tbody><tr><td width="6" align="right" valign="top" style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 0px; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/tools/saved-travellers" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543098/qa_primary_cta_l.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></font></a></td><td height="40" bgcolor="#E40000" align="center" valign="middle" class="w100perc applelinkwhite" style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); height: 40px; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0px 10px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/tools/saved-travellers" target="_blank" alt="Manage your account" title="Manage your account" style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px; line-height: 16px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Manage your account</font></a></td><td width="6" align="left" valign="top" style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 0px; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/tools/saved-travellers" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543099/qa_primary_cta_r.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br><b>Like to know more?</b><br>If you have any questions or need more information:</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 2px 0px;"><img width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 30px; height: 17px;"></div></td><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 4px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Contact Qantas Business Rewards on 13 74 78</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 2px 0px;"><img width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 30px; height: 17px;"></div></td><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 4px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Visit&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">qantasbusinessrewards.com</a></font></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br>Sincerely,<br>Your Qantas Business Rewards Team</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 45px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="font-size: 10px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 10px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 23px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 23px; margin: 0px;"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Important information</font></h3></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 15px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">1. A business must be a Qantas Business Rewards Member and registered for GST or be an Australian Public or Private entity or other incorporated company, and not be a travel agent or on a Corporate Deal with Qantas to earn Qantas Points for the business. Qantas Points for business are offered under the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#airlineterms" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas' Terms and Conditions</a>&nbsp;and earning thresholds apply. Qantas Points earned on air travel are determined in accordance with the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/offer/airlineearntable" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">airline earn table</a>. A Member's ABN and traveller's Qantas Frequent Flyer membership number must be quoted at the time of booking to earn Qantas Points for both the business and the traveller. An eligible flight means a domestic or international flight which has a Qantas 'QF' flight number on the ticket that is purchased in Australia; is operated by Qantas, Emirates or American Airlines; has a ticket number commencing with '081'; and is booked and travelled for business on or after the date the business registers for Qantas Business Rewards.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#definationAirline" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Exclusions apply</a>.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">2. You must be a Qantas Frequent Flyer member to earn Qantas Points. A joining fee may apply. Membership and Qantas Points are subject to the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/program/terms" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas Frequent Flyer program Terms and Conditions</a>. Qantas Points are earned on&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/program/terms#eligibleflights" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">eligible flights</a>&nbsp;with a Qantas or applicable&nbsp;<b>one</b>world® Alliance Airline or Airline Partner flight number on your ticket. Qantas Points may not be earned on some fare types and booking classes. See&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/program/terms#eligibleflights" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">terms and conditions</a>&nbsp;and the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/flying/airline-earning" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Airline Earning Tables</a>. We recommend you consult your accountant or tax adviser to ensure you understand possible tax implications, for example fringe benefits tax (if applicable).</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br><br><br></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>